OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans help to create war
OL,4,Amemorial on roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FA war memorial has been created on a
OL,7,Froundabout by an armed forces social
OL,8,Fenterprise which provides assistance
OL,9,Fdogs for veterans.
OL,11,FThe display, near Leigh Sports Village
OL,12,Fin Greater Manchester, includes 1,900
OL,13,Fpoppies - one for each of the
OL,14,Fservicemen from the Wigan area who made
OL,15,Fthe ultimate sacrifice in World War
OL,16,FOne.
OL,18,FIt also features 1,228 white crosses to
OL,19,Frepresent members of the armed forces
OL,20,Ffrom the same area who were killed in
OL,21,FWorld War Two and subsequent conflicts.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
