OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans help to create war
OL,4,Amemorial on roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge Brooks, who launched The Reeva
OL,7,FProgramme Community Interest Company
OL,8,F(CIC) after serving with the Army in
OL,9,FAfghanistan, said: "We train up therapy
OL,10,Fdogs and hold events to prevent
OL,11,Fveterans from being isolated."
